@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1

### Get all cats
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats

### Add new cat
POST {{baseUrl}}/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "tbonesteak",
  "birthdate": "2024-11-11",
  "weight": 3.5,
  "owner": 3603,
  "filename": "/public/crab.png"
}

### Get all cats after adding
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats
